WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:06.039
&gt;&gt;&gt; THIS MORNING A STUNNING
TRANSFORMATION ON THE

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:08.274
BATTLEFIELD.
UKRAINE BREAKING THROUGH RUSSIAN

00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:12.245
LINES NEAR KHARKIV AND RETAKING
TOWNS THAT HAVE BEEN UNDER

00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:13.613
RUSSIAN CONTROL FOR MONTH.
YOU CAN SEE THEM RAISING A FLAG

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:16.082
IN ONE OF THESE TOUPS.
LET ME SHOW YOU ON THE MAP

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:17.917
EXACTLY WHERE THIS IS TAKING
PLACE.

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:21.621
EVERYWHERE YOU SEE IN YELLOW
HERE IS NOW UNDER UKRAINIAN

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:25.792
CONTROL UNTIL A FEW DAYS AGO IT
WAS ALL UNDER RUSSIAN CONTROL.

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:29.529
THIS HAS HAPPENED WITH STUNNING
REPETTY INCLUDING YOU CAN SEE

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:33.032
RIGHT HERE, THE TOWN, THE CITY
OF IZIUM WHICH WAS A KEY

00:00:33.032 --> 00:00:37.437
CONQUEST BY THE RUSSIANS EARLY
ON IN THE CONFLICT, THAT IS NOW

00:00:37.437 --> 00:00:40.640
MOSTLY UNDER UKRAINIAN CONTROL.
LET'S GO RIGHT TO CNN'S MELISSA

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:43.643
BELL LIVE IN KHARKIV THIS
MORNING WITH THIS REMARKABLE

00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:48.982
TURN AROUND, MELISSA.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: JOHN, QUITE

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:51.117
EXTRAORDINARY.
SOME 3,000 SQUARE KILOMETERS

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:54.154
THAT ARE NOW IN UKRAINIAN HANDS
SAY UKRAINIAN AUTHORITIES.

00:00:54.154 --> 00:00:57.223
BUT REMEMBER THAT THIS IS REALLY
HARD FOR US TO VERIFY BECAUSE OF

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:59.993
THE MEDIA BLACKOUT.
JOURNALISTS JUST NOT ALLOWED TO

00:00:59.993 --> 00:01:03.363
GET CLOSE TO THE FRONT LINES OF
THOSE COUNTEROFFENSIVES.

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:08.334
AND YET, CNN WAS ABLE TO GET
EXCLUSIVE ACCESS TO THE TOWN

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:11.638
JUST TO THE NORTH OF ID YUM THAT
YOU JUST SAW.

00:01:11.638 --> 00:01:16.943
WHAT WE FOUND, JOHN, EVEN THOUGH
A UKRAINIAN FLAG HAS BEEN RAISED

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:21.614
SOMEWHERE, IT DOES NOT
NECESSARILY MEAN THAT THE

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:27.053
FIGHTING IS DONE.
THE TANKS SPOKE TO A HASTY

00:01:27.053 --> 00:01:31.157
RUSSIAN RETREAT AS UKRAINIAN
FORCES SWEPT EAST WARDS OVER THE

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:35.962
WEEKEND.
TRIUMPHANTLY RAISING THE FLAG ON

00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:37.964
SATURDAY.
LOCAL POLICE FORCES PROVIDING

00:01:37.964 --> 00:01:45.471
CNN WITH EXCLUSIVE ACCESS TO A
KEY TOWN NOW MEANT TO BE UNDER

00:01:45.471 --> 00:01:47.907
UKRAINIAN CONTROL.
WE STILL FEEL UNEASY BECAUSE WE

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:55.648
HAVE BEEN BOMBED FOR FOUR DAYS
IN A ROW AND NOTHING IS CERTAIN

00:01:55.648 --> 00:01:59.686
YET.
WHICH ONLY BECAME CLEARER AS WE

00:01:59.686 --> 00:02:11.564
HEADED FURTHER IN.
A FIRST ARTILLERY STRIKE.

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:18.538
TOO CLOSE FOR COMFORT.
THEN A SECOND.

00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:22.308
MUCH CLOSER.
THAT WAS THE SOUND OF ARTILLERY

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:27.179
LANDING JUST NEXT TO OUR CAR.
OUR ARMORED CAR.

00:02:27.179 --> 00:02:30.350
WE HAVE COME HOPING TO GET TO
THAT FLAG TO SEE WHERE IT HAD

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:34.654
BEEN PLOTTED ONLY YESTERDAY, BUT
AS YOU CAN SEE, THIS SUNDAY

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:37.457
AFTERNOON AND STILL THE SCENE OF
SOME PRETTY FIERCE FIGHTING.

00:02:37.457 --> 00:02:40.159
WE HAVE BEEN HEARING THE SOUND
OF OUTGOING ARTILLERY FIRE.

00:02:40.159 --> 00:02:44.964
THAT WAS THE SOUND OF INCOMING.
TWO HITS DIRECTLY TARGETING OUR

00:02:44.964 --> 00:02:49.102
CAR, SAYS THE POLICEMAN.
TIME TO GO BACK TO WHAT WE HAD

00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:52.571
COME TO SEE.
THOSE PARTS OF KHARKIV REGION

00:02:52.571 --> 00:03:00.947
FULLY UNDER UKRAINIAN CONTROL.
WHERE AFTER SIX MONTHS OF

00:03:00.947 --> 00:03:03.783
OCCUPATION, UKRAINIAN
INVESTIGATORS KNOW ALL TOO WELL

00:03:03.783 --> 00:03:07.754
WHAT THEY'LL FIND.
AFTER BUCHA THAT WERE UNDER

00:03:07.754 --> 00:03:11.257
RUSSIAN CONTROL FOR ONLY A
MONTH.

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:13.993
YES, ACCORDING TO OUR
INFORMATION, WE ARE RECORDING

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:18.731
WAR CRIMES IN ALMOST EVERY
VILLAGE, HE SAYS.

00:03:18.731 --> 00:03:23.903
THIS, THE BODY OF ONE OF TWO
CIVILIANS KILLED IN LATE

00:03:23.903 --> 00:03:27.206
FEBRUARY.
AN EARLY VICTIM OF THE INVASION

00:03:27.206 --> 00:03:38.551
AND EVIDENCE NOW OF WHAT SIX
CONTINUING HERE IN EASTERN

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:41.054
KHARKIV, EVEN AS YOU SAW THERE
THE FIGHT CONTINUES AND BITTERLY

00:03:41.054 --> 00:03:42.955
FOR THE UKRAINIAN FORCES TRYING
TO REGAIN GROUND, JOHN.

00:03:42.955 --> 00:03:47.560
&gt;&gt;&gt; THIS MORNING THE U.S.
GROWING CONCERN THAT MOSCOW'S

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:51.864
WEAPONIZATION OF OIL AND GAS
COULD CAUSE DIVISION IN EUROPE'S

00:03:51.864 --> 00:03:53.933
UNITED FRONT AGAINST RUSSIA'S
WAR ON UKRAINE.

00:03:53.933 --> 00:04:00.406
IT COMES AS EUROPE FACES A TOUGH
WINTER AND SKYROCKETING COSTS

00:04:00.406 --> 00:04:05.445
AFTER RUSSIA SHUT OFF FLOWS
THROUGH A KEY PIPELINE.

00:04:05.445 --> 00:04:07.980
TELL US ABOUT THE CONCERNS.
&gt;&gt; THEY'RE WARNING OF A TOUGH

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:10.917
WINTER.
EUROPEAN LEADERS ARE SAYING

00:04:10.917 --> 00:04:13.019
THERE COULD BE BLACKOUTS ACROSS
EUROPE.

00:04:13.019 --> 00:04:18.791
PEOPLE ARE TAKING TO THE STREETS
TO PROTEST THE SKYROCKETING

00:04:18.791 --> 00:04:26.532
ENERGY COSTS AND PRESIDENT PUTIN
SHUTOFF FLOWS TO EUROPE LAST

00:04:26.532 --> 00:04:30.269
WEEK SAYING HE WON'T TURN THEM
BACK ON UNTIL SANCTIONS ARE

00:04:30.269 --> 00:04:31.904
LIFTED.
THE WHITE HOUSE IS SAYING RIGHT

00:04:31.904 --> 00:04:37.577
NOW WE DON'T SEE ANY REAL SIGNS
THAT EUROPEAN UNITY ON PUNISHING

00:04:37.577 --> 00:04:41.447
RUSSIA IS FRACTURING AT THIS
POINT BUT THEY'RE CONCERNED

00:04:41.447 --> 00:04:44.617
THAT'S EASY TO SAY AND DO WHEN
IT'S SUMMER.

00:04:44.617 --> 00:04:49.722
BUT WHEN IT GETS COLD, THE RISK
OF POLITICAL INSTABILITY

00:04:49.722 --> 00:04:52.558
BREAKING OUT AS PRICES GO HIGHER
IS A RISK.

00:04:52.558 --> 00:04:56.696
THEY'RE WATCHING IT CLOSELY.
THAT IS WHY LAST WEEK, WHEN

00:04:56.696 --> 00:05:00.166
PRESIDENT BIDEN CONVENED ALMOST
A DOZEN WESTERN LEADERS ON A

00:05:00.166 --> 00:05:02.635
CALL, THAT WAS HIS CENTRAL
MESSAGE, IT WAS ABOUT ENERGY,

00:05:02.635 --> 00:05:06.038
ABOUT STAYING STRONG, ABOUT HOW
THE UNITED STATES IS WORKING

00:05:06.038 --> 00:05:09.509
REALLY AROUND THE CLOCK HERE TO
TRY TO FIND ALTERNATIVE ENERGY

00:05:09.509 --> 00:05:14.246
SOURCES FOR EUROPE AS RUSSIA
CONTINUES TO WEAPONIZE OIL AND

00:05:14.246 --> 00:05:16.649
GAS AS A RESULT OF THE WAR IN
UKRAINE.

00:05:16.649 --> 00:05:19.252
THERE ARE LINGERING CONCERNS
THAT EUROPE IS GOING TO NOT BE

00:05:19.252 --> 00:05:24.657
ABLE TO COME TO SOME KIND OF
AGREEMENT ON THE QUESTIONS OF AN

00:05:24.657 --> 00:05:28.928
OIL PRICE CAP OR GAS PRICE CAP
BECAUSE THERE ARE SOME COUNTRIES

00:05:28.928 --> 00:05:32.498
IN THE EUROPEAN ALLIANCE SAYING
IF WE DO ANYTHING ELSE TO MAKE

00:05:32.498 --> 00:05:36.535
RUSSIA ANGRY HERE THEY'RE GOING
TO CUT OFF WHAT LITTLE SUPPLIES

00:05:36.535 --> 00:05:41.874
REMAIN TO ALLIES LIKE HUNGARY
FOR EXAMPLE, AUSTRIA ALSO

00:05:41.874 --> 00:05:44.944
CONCERNED ABOUT THIS.
IT REMAINS TO BE SEEN WHAT KIND

00:05:44.944 --> 00:05:48.281
OF THING IS GOING TO BE THE LAST
STRAW HERE IN TERMS OF ANYTHING

00:05:48.281 --> 00:05:51.250
THAT BREAKS THE WESTERN RESOLVE
HERE.

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:54.454
AS WE ARE TALKING ABOUT DURING
THE BREAK IT'S HARDER BECAUSE OF

00:05:54.454 --> 00:05:58.524
THE MOMENTUM THAT WE SEE RUSSIA
HAVING HOWEVER WESTERN

00:05:58.524 --> 00:06:01.494
INTELLIGENCE OFFICIALS -- THAT
WE SEE UKRAINE HAVING I MEAN.

00:06:01.494 --> 00:06:07.132
BUT A LOT OF OFFICIALS ARE
SAYING THAT IS ONLY GOING TO

00:06:07.132 --> 00:06:11.070
STEEL PUTIN'S RESOLVE TO MAKE
LIFE MORE MISERABLE FOR THE

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:16.008
EUROPEANS AS HE LOSES GROUND IN
UKRAINE AND LIFE GETS HARDER FOR

00:06:16.008 --> 00:06:20.613
RUSSIANS AS THEIR ECONOMY TANKS.
&gt;&gt; HARDER TO PULL THE RUG FROM

00:06:20.613 --> 00:06:24.283
AN ARMY THAT HAS THE MOMENTUM.
GREAT REPORTING, NATASHA, THANK

00:06:24.283 --> 00:06:25.485
YOU SO MUCH. 

